 \begin{cases} A+B=260 \\ B+C=245 \\ C+D=270 \end{cases}
 Sum these equations, we get $A+2B+2C+D=775$. Therefore, $A+D=775-2B-2C=775-2(B+C)=775-490=285$. So, Abby and Damon weigh $\boxed{285}$ pounds together. </think> <answer> 285 </answer>

